# `data/` above matches ANY directory named data, including every evidence
# bundle under doc/research/data/. All 31 tracked evidence files to date landed
# only because someone remembered `git add -f`; the next one to be forgotten
# disappears silently, which is the failure mode evidence bundles exist to
# prevent. Un-exclude the directory itself so git will descend into it.
!doc/research/data/
